      "writtenOn": "2022-12-02T02:05:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks! So with Table 6-74, it looks like our protocol layer is throwing out the Alert because we are receiving a Get_Status message. I\u0027ll look for a way to resend the message after it\u0027s discarded and separate handling for protocol errors.",
